	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Cum nihil plane esset, reverende in Christo pater, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quod tua scire interesset, tamen, quod tuas accepissem <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quodque d. consul res <placeName>Danicas</placeName> et <placeName>Svedicas</placeName> ea lege <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>in manus meas resignasset, ut ad te remitterem, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>scribendum simul putavi, ut saltem hoc unum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>scires me nihil habere, quod scriberem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Hodie <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>diu cum d. <persName ref="p3196">Tscharnero</persName> de rebus <placeName ref="l832">Gallicis</placeName> sum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>colloquutus exque illius verbis intellexi res <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nostrorum satis illic esse lubricas, nisi quod <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>d. <persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> ad me scribit Christum tamen <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>mirabiliter tryumphare interim; est ultimus <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>hic pontificius conatus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Te legisse existimo bullam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>pontificis, qua concilium confirmat et simul <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>observantissimum filium suum <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandum</persName>, imperatorem <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>electum, qui tunc superstes erat, aliosque principes <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et respublicas, qui suos oratores ad concilium miserunt, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>gravissime exhortatur, ut, quod patribus coram <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>receperunt, id factis quoque praestent suisque auxilio <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>sint ad id exequendum, quod concilii canones <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>dictant.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sed nunc hic obedientissimus filius, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>cuius auxilio pontifex in procurando hoc concilio <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>se potissimum usum profitetur, mortuus est; <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>fortassis aliqua quoque practicae pars cum illo est <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>sepulta.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">- Scribit senatus ad nostrum, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quae ad causam <placeName ref="l646">Glaronensem</placeName> pertinent; additae <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sunt literae <placeName ref="l2450">Svitensium</placeName> ad <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinos</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Legi et m<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>iror impudentiam <placeName ref="l2450">Svitensium</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quis enim <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>non intelligat, quam aperte <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinorum</placeName> religionem <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>perstringant, ad quos ipsi scribunt?</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sed hoc miror: <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>senatum vestrum in suis ad nostrum literis mortem <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Caesaris non pro certo affirmare, cum de ea hic nihil <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>dubitetur amplius.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">- Expectabatur omnino hic <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>legatus <persName>Philippi</persName>, et iam illius factionis homines <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>cristas erigebant, quas nunc, cum venire differt, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>paulatim remittunt; spem tamen eius adventus <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>nondum omnem deposuerunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">De <persName>Hannibale</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>nihil interim, quod mirum est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Te quęso rogoque, <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>mi reverende pater, has literulas digneris mittere <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>ad d. <persName ref="p252">Bäldium</persName>, cui sunt inscriptae; respondeo ad <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>eas, quas novissime ad me scripsit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Als ich vor<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>langest etwas von junckher <persName>Ambrosi</persName> und <persName ref="p20234">Luci Guge<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>lbärg</persName>, den zween brüderen, uß begär h[errn] <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosi <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Blorer</persName> geschriben und daamalen h[errn] <persName ref="p3196">Tscharners</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>radt gebrucht, der mir die 2 beschrib ires stands <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>und wäsens halb, hyezwüschen von im villicht denen <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>knaben ettwas der dochter halb endtdeckt, und ich <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>widerum gefraaget, wär der sye, so die dochter vogtswyß <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>by im hatt, darby ich wol gespür, das die Gugelbergen <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>nit sonders deren dingen bericht: ist myn bitt an üch, <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>so üch des h[errn] Ambrosiß schryben noch yngedenck, <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>mich mit einem wort desse in stille ze berichten; wil <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>es wol der bescheydenheyt nach wüssen ze bruchen, menniglich <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>on schaden.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Das thuͦtt aber nit nott; so ir meer schrybend, <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>so gedenckend sy mit 2 worten; dan in des h[errn] <persName ref="p8055">Blorers</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>brieff an üch stuͦnd, wie ir demselben, so syn <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>baß in synem schutz hätte, vor ettwan ouch gedienet <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>hättind, ouch wol um in verdient wärind.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">- <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>Caetera nos dei gratia adhuc valemus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Pestis hic <lb xml:id="p2z31"/><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> nulla, a qua tamen interim <placeName ref="l648">Rhetia</placeName> non <pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>est immunis.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Audimus hic pestem <placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName> ingravescere, <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>de quo tu nobis melius.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Parentibus <persName>Heinrici</persName> <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>qui ad te venit, id significari curavi; tanto vos <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>estis <placeName ref="l98">Curiensibus</placeName> humaniores, qui illum non recepissent, qui <lb xml:id="p3z5"/>ex peste venit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Sed tamen te, quod ad illum (secreto tamen), <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>monitum volo, ne familiarem tibi tuisque facias; est homo <lb xml:id="p3z7"/>capitis valde h terocliti, licet primo congressu talis neutiquam <lb xml:id="p3z8"/>appareat; sed ubi se prodit, est satis inquietus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Daa <lb xml:id="p3z9"/>ers als versuͦcht und die synen es als mit im versuͦcht <lb xml:id="p3z10"/>und nienan nüt söllen, vermeint er, noch zuͦ einem <lb xml:id="p3z11"/>prędicanten guͦtt gnuͦg ze syn.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Sed haec tibi; nullum enim <lb xml:id="p3z12"/>sanum consilium homo ille admittit.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, reverende <lb xml:id="p3z13"/>in Christo pater, cum tuis omnibus quam felicissime <lb xml:id="p3z14"/>et diutissime.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 14. augusti anno 1564.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p8009">Fabricius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z15"/>Scripsi ad amicos <placeName ref="l167">Genevae</placeName>, ut, si liber illic excuderetur, <lb xml:id="p3z16"/>exemplaria quaedam pauca ad te <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> mittantur, inde ad <lb xml:id="p3z17"/>me per meos <placeName ref="l98">Curiam</placeName>, quod quidem non alio nomine <lb xml:id="p3z18"/>a me factum est, quam quod nomen tuum illic <lb xml:id="p3z19"/>celebre et in procurandis exemplaribus tanto minus <lb xml:id="p3z20"/>periculi.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Itaque, quod hac in re tua opera abutor, <lb xml:id="p3z21"/>mihi ignosce; cum venerint, tu d. <persName ref="p4554">Collino</persName> socero <lb xml:id="p3z22"/>tradito; is curabit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Si quid pro vectura expendendum, <lb xml:id="p3z23"/>ego bona fide solvam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Tu unum aut alterum exemplar r<lb xml:id="p3z24"/>etine; caetera omnia ad me mittantur; nam <lb xml:id="p3z25"/>in <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> eorum maior usus erit quam apud <placeName ref="l822">Germanos</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z26"/>Misi quaedam epitaphia d. <persName ref="p540">Calvini</persName> ad d. <persName ref="p4554">Collinum</persName>; <lb xml:id="p3z27"/>quae si non vidisti, inspicere poteß.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Amplissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, domino suo <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>et in Christo patri multum <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>honorando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p4z5"/>An herren <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
